    "id": "Q11",
    "text": "Reagents that can be used to convert alcohols to carboxylic acids are: (a) CrO₃ - H₂SO₄ (b) K₂Cr₂O₇ + H₂SO₄ (c) KMnO₄ + KOH/H₃O⁺ (d) Cu, 573 K (e) CrO₃ + (CH₃CO)₂O",
